MY CONTROL / BANTU BERES SALES CONTROL CENTER
SATU WORKFLOW N8N — AI AGENT

Zona:
A. WAHA INBOUND → dedupe → Supabase → ACK cepat
B. AI WORKER → 3 Gemini Flash slots → Flash-Lite fallback
C. OUTBOUND WORKER → WAHA send → retry tanpa memanggil AI ulang
D. FOLLOW-UP SCHEDULER → follow-up AI yang sudah direncanakan agent

Sebelum Publish:
1) jalankan SQL companion;
2) set environment variables;
3) pilih 4 Gemini credentials/model nodes;
4) hubungkan webhook WAHA ke Production URL;
5) test end-to-end.

